COPY public.journey_timeline (id, date, title, description, image_url, display_order, is_active, created_at, updated_at, title_am, description_am) FROM stdin;
26	2025-05-05	Future Horizons: Children's Museum	Following the grand inauguration, the complex is actively undergoing a major expansion to establish a dedicated, state-of-the-art Children's Museum. This new wing is designed to foster interactive learning, creative exploration, and historical education tailored specifically for the next generation.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/3fecaac7a80a5161193929d6ed521d0a	5	t	2025-08-27 00:28:57.402932	2026-07-22 10:05:34.782734		
28	2026-06-28	Smart Museum: Digital Access	To ensure a world-class and globally accessible visitor experience, the memorial is actively developing an immersive multilingual Audio Guide system and an interactive Virtual Tour platform, allowing global guests to explore our historic treasures from anywhere in the world.		6	t	2026-06-28 10:34:46.699306	2026-07-22 10:05:34.78328		
1	1896-03-01	Victory of Sovereignty	On March 1, 1896, united Ethiopian forces under the strategic leadership of Emperor Menelik II and Empress Taytu Betul decisively defeated the Italian colonial army at the Battle of Adwa. This monumental triumph permanently preserved national independence and ignited the global flame of Pan-African liberation.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/3874ccb27fc38dd7fbf476c3fb377c28	0	t	2025-08-25 10:59:47.487275	2026-07-22 10:05:34.779248		
2	2023-05-05	A Century-Old Aspiration	For generations, establishing a grand, centralized memorial in the heart of the capital remained a sacred national desire. The vision was to create a permanent sanctuary that would eternally honor the absolute unity, bravery, and resilience of the patriots who defended African liberty.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/1f9dd82645c332df281443e20e070713	1	t	2025-08-25 11:01:53.326107	2026-07-22 10:05:34.780338		
13	2023-07-10	Architectural Revival	Conceived through the visionary initiative of Prime Minister Dr. Abiy Ahmed, the Addis Ababa City Administration spearheaded the grand design and construction of a state-of-the-art historical complex in the historic Piassa district, transforming the heart of the city into a monumental landmark.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/51012b3a7c984af2ef74184076d65360	2	t	2025-08-26 18:48:54.186301	2026-07-22 10:05:34.781041	የመሠረት ሥነ ሥርዓት	
24	2024-01-10	The Historic Unveiling	On February 11, 2024, the ultra-modern Adwa Victory Memorial was officially and grandly inaugurated. The landmark stood realized as a magnificent symbol of national pride, dignity, and a world-class center for historical reflection.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/cf1cc3cdbca81c61e3d5c00b0ff97b03	3	t	2025-08-27 00:28:57.399984	2026-07-22 10:05:34.78165		
25	2024-03-14	Open to the Public	On March 16, 2024, the memorial officially opened its doors to the general public. It began welcoming local citizens, international scholars, and tourists from the global African diaspora to experience its immersive exhibitions, the 2,500-seat Pan African Hall, and vibrant community spaces.	https://adwavictorymemorial.gov.et/api/uploads/content-images/7e29fb794b641570bf639f29a5960837	4	t	2025-08-27 00:28:57.401712	2026-07-22 10:05:34.782188		
\.
COPY public.mission_vision_values (id, type, title, description, display_order, is_active, created_at, updated_at, title_am, description_am) FROM stdin;
50698	value	Historical  Integrity 	We present and preserve the history of Adwa with \nuncompromising accuracy, scholarly rigour, and \nintellectual honesty. Every artifact, exhibition, publication, and programme reflects our \ncommitment to truth as the highest form of respect \nfor those who fought at Adwa.	0	t	2025-08-26 18:27:57.060102	2026-07-22 10:05:34.161861	ታሪካዊ ታማኝነት	"የአድዋን ታሪክ ያለ ምንም ችግር በትክክለኛነት፣ በምሁራዊ ጥራት እና በእውቀታዊ ታማኝነት እናቀርባለን፣ እንዲሁም እንጠብቃለን። እያንዳንዱ ቅርስ፣ ኤግዚቢሽን፣ ህትመት እና ፕሮግራም ለአድዋ ተዋጊዎች ያለንን ከፍተኛ ክብር የምናሳይበት የእውነት ቁርጠኝነታችን ነፀብራቅ ነው።"
50700	value	Pan-African  Pride 	We honour Adwa as a victory not only for Ethiopia, \nbut for all African people and all of humanity. We \ncelebrate the equality of human beings, the dignity \nof self-determination, and the power of collective \nresistance. Every programme, partnership, and \npublication reflects our identity as a global \ninstitution in service of African heritage.	1	t	2025-08-26 18:44:51.258951	2026-07-22 10:05:34.236521	 የትምህርት ልቀት	"አድዋን የኢትዮጵያ ብቻ ሳይሆን የመላው አፍሪካውያን እና የሰው ዘር በሙሉ ድል አድርገን እናከብረዋለን። የሰው ልጆችን እኩልነት፣ የራስን ዕድል በራስ የመወሰንን ክብር እና የጋራ ተቃውሞን ኃይል በታላቅ ኩራት እናነሳለን። እያንዳንዱ ፕሮግራም፣ አጋርነት እና ህትመት የአፍሪካን ቅርስ ለማገልገል የቆምን ዓለም አቀፋዊ ተቋም የመሆናችንን መገለጫ የሚያንጸባርቅ ነው።"
50701	value	Generational  Stewardship	We are custodians of history on behalf of future \ngenerations. Every acquisition, conservation \ndecision, and educational programme is evaluated \nagainst its long-term legacy value.	2	t	2025-08-26 23:44:05.937781	2026-07-22 10:05:34.296653	የትውልድ ጠባቂነት	"እኛ የወደፊቱን ትውልድ ወክለን የታሪክ አደራ ጠባቂዎች ነን። እያንዳንዱ የቅርስ ግዢ፣ የጥበቃ ውሳኔ እና የትምህርት ፕሮግራም የሚመዘነው ለዘላቂው ቅርስ ባለው የረጅም ጊዜ እሴት ላይ ተመስርቶ ነው።"
50704	value	Multiculturalism	We recognise and celebrate the diverse cultures, \npeoples, and perspectives that converge at Adwa, a \nbattle won by a united Ethiopia and witnessed by \nthe world. The Memorial is a space where every \nidentity is respected, every heritage is honoured, \nand the shared story of human dignity transcends \nborders of ethnicity, language, and nationality.	3	t	2025-09-02 19:29:49.989162	2026-07-22 10:05:34.354485	ብዝሃ-ባህላዊነት	የተባበረችው ኢትዮጵያ በአሸነፈችውና መላው ዓለም በታዘበው በአድዋ ጦርነት ላይ የተገናኙትን ልዩ ልዩ ባህሎች፣ ሕዝቦች እና አመለካከቶች እንገነዘባለን፣ እንዲሁም እናከብራለን። መታሰቢያው እያንዳንዱ ማንነት የሚከበርበት፣ እያንዳንዱ ቅርስ የሚታወስበት፣ እና የጋራ የሆነው የሰው ልጅ ክብር ታሪክ ከዘር፣ ከቋንቋ እና ከዜግነት ድንበሮች በላይ የሚሻገርበት ስፍራ ነው።
50708	value	Patriotism	We carry a deep and abiding love for Ethiopia, its \npeople, its sovereignty, and its history. The \nMemorial stands as a monument to those who gave \neverything to defend that sovereignty at Adwa, and \nwe honour their sacrifice by serving the nation with \ndedication, pride, and purpose. Patriotism here is \nnot exclusive pride but an inspiring example: the \ncourage of Adwa belongs to Ethiopia and speaks to \nall humanity.	4	t	2026-07-22 10:05:34.434982	2026-07-22 10:05:34.434982	ሀገር ወዳድነት	ለኢትዮጵያ፣ ለሕዝቧ፣ ለሉዓላዊነቷ እና ለታሪኳ ጥልቅና ዘላቂ ፍቅር አለን። መታሰቢያው በአድዋ ያንን ሉዓላዊነት ለመከላከል ሁሉንም ነገር ለሰጡት ጀግኖች የቆመ ሀውልት ነው፤ እኛም በቁርጠኝነት፣ በኩራት እና ዓላማ ባለው አገልግሎት ሀገራችንን በማገልገል መስዋዕትነታቸውን እናከብራለን። እዚህ ላይ ሀገር ወዳድነት ለብቻ የሚገለለ ኩራት ሳይሆን አርአያ የሚሆን ምሳሌ ነው፤ የአድዋ ጀግንነት የኢትዮጵያ ሀብት ሲሆን ለሰው ልጅ በሙሉ የሚናገር ነው።
50709	value	Inclusive  Excellence 	We pursue the highest standards of museum \npractice, research, education, and visitor \nexperience, and we make those standards \naccessible to every person, regardless of age, \nability, nationality, or background. Excellence \nwithout inclusivity serves only the privileged. We \nserve the many.	5	t	2026-07-22 10:05:34.535469	2026-07-22 10:05:34.535469	ሁሉን አቀፍ ልህቀት	በሙዚየም አሰራር፣ በምርምር፣ በትምህርት እና በጎብኝዎች አገልግሎት ረገድ ከፍተኛውን ደረጃ ለመድረስ እንተጋለን፤ እነዚህንም መመዘኛዎች ዕድሜ፣ ችሎታ፣ ዜግነት ወይም የጀርባ ታሪክ ሳይገድበው ለሁሉም ሰው ተደራሽ እናደርጋለን። ሁሉን አቀፍ ያልሆነ ጥራት ጥቂት ባለመብቶችን ብቻ ያገለግላል። እኛ ግን አብዛኛውን እናገለግላለን።
50710	value	Innovation with  Purpose 	We embrace technology, creativity, and new \napproaches to deepen engagement, extend reach, and strengthen preservation, always in service of \nour mission, never as an end in itself. Innovation is \na means; Adwa’s legacy is the end.	6	t	2026-07-22 10:05:34.594194	2026-07-22 10:05:34.594194	ዓላማ ተኮር ፈጠራ	ግንኙነትን ለማስፋፋት፣ ተደራሽነትን ለማሳደግ እና የቅርስ ጥበቃን ለማጠናከር ቴክኖሎጂን፣ ፈጠራን እና አዳዲስ አቀራረቦችን እንቀበላለን፤ ይህንን የምናደርገው ሁልጊዜም ለተልዕኳችን ስኬት እንጂ ቴክኖሎጂው በራሱ የመጨረሻ ግብ ስለሆነ አይደለም። ፈጠራ መድረሻ መንገድ ነው፤ የአድዋ ቅርስ ግን የመጨረሻው ግባችን ነው።
1	mission	Our Mission	“To preserve, interpret, and celebrate the legacy of the Adwa Victory - history’s \ngreatest triumphs of courage, unity, and human dignity-  through world-class \nheritage stewardship, inclusive education, research excellence, and \ntransformative visitor experiences, empowering Ethiopians, Africans, and the \nglobal community to draw enduring strength, pride, and inspiration.”	0	t	2025-08-24 01:22:22.819349	2026-07-22 10:05:34.013086	 የእኛ ተልዕኮ	
